Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.11,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,A proxy confession service, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:10.03,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. We were thinking of using \Nthe lunchtime broadcast for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.62,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You know the school rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.17,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Relationships aren't allowed on paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:16.04,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,So we didn't want to be found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:18.37,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That rule's not really \Nenforced, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:20.29,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,So, can we go ahead with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:21.29,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Nope. Sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:23.25,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Saw that coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:25.39,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I don't want to get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:28.00,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You and your \Nnever-rock-the-boat attitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:31.69,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,My life goal is to go to the grave \Nwithout ever making waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:34.32,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why did she even become a teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.15,0:00:36.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Ando-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:38.14,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's an honor to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:44.25,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Please allow yours truly to enlighten you \Non the benefits of this service.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:45.44,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,You're annoying. And fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:46.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:49.17,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,This is why I didn't \Nwant boys in this club.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:53.03,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,All you think about is being popular, \Nso you always act like you're hot shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:54.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Th-This is tyranny!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:00:59.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Please, Lemon-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:01.87,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I really want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.16,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,It's not every day you stick \Nto your guns, Uzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:06.25,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,But it's still a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.69,0:01:08.25,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Because this sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.25,0:01:10.99,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yeah, why did she become a teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:12.97,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,There's something in it \Nfor you too, Lemon-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:18.59,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Our club bombed last year's sports day, \Nbut we're nailing it this year, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:19.77,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:20.68,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Are you aware?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.09,0:01:23.81,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Your stock is rising fast right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:28.11,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If this event goes well too,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:31.97,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,your stock as a teacher \Nwill go through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:34.70,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A peaceful life is nice and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:37.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but the view from the top \Nof the world is pretty great, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.57,0:01:44.38,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,What are you standing around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:46.46,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.64,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,What a self-serving teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:49.38,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.92,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,What's first on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.92,0:01:53.17,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Handing out flyers on the sly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.17,0:01:55.05,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,That's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:56.24,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.93,0:02:00.27,Broadcast - Top,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Listen up! Boys and girls sit separately!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:02.81,Broadcast - Top,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,No relationships until you're twenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.01,0:02:02.81,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.01,Broadcast,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.52,Main - Top,NENE,0,0,0,,It's Samejima, the P.E. teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:08.27,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,He's watching the students during lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:11.64,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Just try handing those flyers out \Nwhere he can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:14.45,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}PROXY CONFESSIONS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:13.34,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,It'll be a scandal before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:14.45,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,True...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.45,0:02:17.86,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What now? People can't \Nshow up if they don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.86,0:02:19.57,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We could use the group chats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:22.60,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We won't reach the first- \Nand third-years with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:26.21,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Hey, why do you think I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.21,0:02:27.31,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,To slack?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:29.50,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I'll distract Samejima.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:33.62,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I can buy you ten minutes at most. \NHand them out in that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.10,0:02:35.43,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Lemon-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.43,0:02:37.00,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:39.68,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Now hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:41.86,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Operation Lemon is underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.86,0:02:43.53,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Quit taking credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:44.69,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Quit taking charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:48.98,Broadcast,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,You there! Stop talking \Nto the girls for no reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:52.53,Broadcast,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Break the rules, and you'll have to \Nwrite an apology letter on the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:53.38,Main,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,So annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:54.65,Main,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,His pecs are gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:58.12,Broadcast,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Sensei sees all! Remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:00.12,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Samejima-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:02.51,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,You're working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:05.75,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Why don't we teachers \Ntake a quick break, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.33,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Oh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:09.46,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,I'm on supervision duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:12.76,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,A quick break... A quickie, if you will?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:15.51,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Let's take a break \Nuntil the turn of the century!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:17.66,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,We can rest in the shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:18.79,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:22.99,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,She sucks at winking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:24.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now's our chance! Hand those flyers out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:28.05,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We're the broadcasting club.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:30.35,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We're holding a lunchtime event.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:32.48,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Feel free to take part.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:34.45,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Don't tell the teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:35.63,Main,GIRL 3,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:36.82,Main,GIRL 4,0,0,0,,That sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:40.60,Main,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Whoa! I got a flyer from Himekawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:42.83,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't be so loud about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:47.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We do need to grab attention \Nto let everyone know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:51.27,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What do we do? We can't be \Ntoo loud, or Sensei will notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.27,0:03:53.28,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How to catch the eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oh, gather round, broadcasting club.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.45,0:03:59.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You're dismissed, errand boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.37,0:04:03.74,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,So I've got a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:04.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:05.87,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:08.83,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,N-No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:10.30,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey, it's a fun idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:11.85,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:13.01,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:14.23,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Well, I'm against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.99,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Just do it, Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.99,0:04:19.08,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Do this for Shinobu \Nand make her event a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.12,Main,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.62,Main,BOY 2,0,0,0,,Whoa! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.69,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We're the broadcasting club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:30.45,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We're hosting an event at lunch, \Nand everyone can participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:32.77,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,P-Please join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.77,0:04:34.67,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Have a flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:36.98,Main,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Squee! Rikka-chan's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:38.58,Main,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Uzuki-san's adorbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:40.38,Main,GIRL 3,0,0,0,,Look this way, Nene-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.51,Main,BOY 3,0,0,0,,What's happening? Let's go check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:45.59,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Good thing I left my costumes at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:47.79,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I-It's kind of embarrassing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.07,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,A moustache?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:52.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You owe me some cake later, Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Ah, they're brute-forcing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:58.23,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can see why they \Ndidn't need an errand boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:05:00.02,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Y-Yamabuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:04.62,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I can't do this! This operation is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:06.33,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,You've got explosive speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:08.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey! Why'd you bring him here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.37,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:11.40,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,What's with that crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:13.27,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.57,0:05:15.58,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:16.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:18.63,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.63,0:05:20.09,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,State your names!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:25.67,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:27.88,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I lost my pom-poms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:29.40,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,That was spine-tingling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:30.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm never doing that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:33.27,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But we're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:36.62,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Now we just pray that people \Nwho want to confess show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:40.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Let's go over the process one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:48.45,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}CONFESSORS\NIKO-NENE-RIKKA-SHINOBU
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:45.11,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,First, the confessors will wait \Nin the next classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:48.75,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We'll be standing by there \Nto assist them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:52.44,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,The room's dark, so nobody \Ncan see who's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:54.42,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Privacy is guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:59.92,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.59,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,When it's their turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:05:59.92,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,they'll go use the string phone \Nby the broadcasting room's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:03.43,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Shinobu, you sure about listening to \Nand broadcasting the confessions yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:05.76,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yeah, I want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.57,0:06:07.64,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.60,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Okay, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.69,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:10.70,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:16.31,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Let's show them what the \Nbroadcasting club can do this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:17.89,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.69,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wow, this is actually happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:24.03,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.37,0:06:25.78,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm getting nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:30.22,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But if I can't do this, I have no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:35.59,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wait, we have a visitor already? \NThe event only starts at lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:36.67,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:38.59,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.80,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Okay, your confession, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:46.61,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,Flub your lines, \Nand you'll have to do a dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:48.91,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Stay calm and keep it together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:52.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't prank me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:55.51,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Sheesh... Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:58.39,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Who do you think it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:06:59.88,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Were you able to hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:01.67,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It was over the string phone, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:07.95,Main,EPTITLEA,0,0,0,,{\an8}I CAN'T TELL WHOSE VOICE IT WAS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:42.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The morning events have concluded \Nwith Team White in the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.88,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}TEAM RED - TEAM WHITE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:45.40,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We'll now break for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:49.15,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The proxy confessions will now \Ncommence as announced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:51.30,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,What? Confessions?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:53.16,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Samejima-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:57.77,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Why don't we have lunch together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:08:59.84,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Yes! I am the eater of worlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:02.22,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If you want to make a confession,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:05.69,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,please head to the empty classroom \Non the third floor of the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:07.82,Main,GIRL 5,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:23.25,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Here comes the first confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.59,0:09:26.61,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"There's someone I've liked for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:30.86,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's Shindo-kun from Class 2-A.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:37.85,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I've been in love with you \Never since the day we first spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.35,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If you know who I am—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:45.52,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,if you're willing to accept my feelings—\Nwould you please stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:52.20,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's all for my confession."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:54.47,Main,TEACHER A,0,0,0,,What is this broadcast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.47,0:09:57.04,Main,CLASSTEACHER,0,0,0,,Hey, this is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:59.37,Main,TEACHER B,0,0,0,,Samejima-sensei might lose it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:02.43,Main,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,Wh-Why don't we go get \Nprotein shakes sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:04.71,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:06.84,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Here comes the next confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:08.51,Main,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Maybe I should go for it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:09.59,Main,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Wanna sneak out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.59,0:10:12.82,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Shindo, you lucky dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.05,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,There was a real chance \Nnobody would show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:17.68,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,but I guess I had \Nnothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:21.37,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wow, they're getting all hyped about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:23.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Everybody loves relationship talk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.26,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Curtains closed, Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:27.70,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,If we let sunlight in, \Nit'll reveal the confessors' faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:29.48,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oops, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:33.28,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is a huge hit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:35.84,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Are we awesome or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.84,0:10:38.28,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Well, it's Shinobu's event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.76,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We're gonna be partying tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:43.79,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Shinobu's plan really worked out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:47.79,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,People want to express their feelings \Nwith their voice, not letters or texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:51.96,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But phone calls can get awkward, so \Nwe give them the perfect alternative...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:53.70,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,with our proxy service.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:56.72,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"Takahashi-san \Nfrom Class 1-D, I love you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:58.55,Main,TAKAHASHI,0,0,0,,Dunno who you are, but I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.25,Main,TAKAHASHI,0,0,0,,I already have a boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:02.92,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Damn, someone got rejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:04.73,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I said curtains closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:06.60,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,By the way, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:09.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Do you have anything you want to confess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:13.19,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:16.31,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It can be something other than \Nexpressing your feelings, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:18.94,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, I totally knew what you meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.77,0:11:25.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I do have something \NI can't say to their face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:26.33,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:28.63,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:32.25,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,There's this one person \Nwho did a lot to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:34.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,But I butted heads with them \Nout of embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.70,0:11:37.99,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I don't really care \Nwhat they think of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:41.95,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,but I would like to say I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:43.18,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:47.45,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,As for me, what I'd like to confess is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:50.61,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I was being really cold to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:55.46,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I wanna tell him that he wasn't to blame, \Nand that it was all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:12:00.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly making myself clear, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.27,0:12:01.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.15,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And you, Iko?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.15,0:12:07.33,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Well, I was voice chatting with someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:11.96,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,but I suddenly stopped talking \Nand made them freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:16.72,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I just wanna, um, tell them \Nnot to worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:22.05,Main,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:26.06,Main,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,I'd like to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:26.89,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,A visitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:28.25,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:30.44,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Nobody can see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:47.53,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:49.83,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,It was just getting good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.75,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:55.73,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:01.07,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:03.93,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll break things even more \Nif I try to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:09.37,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Why am I always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:12.00,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I always come up short when it counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:13.06,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:15.32,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll just prove her right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:19.07,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh no... I'm going to cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:21.07,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Everything okay, Shinobu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:23.20,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:26.15,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hoo boy... I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:28.91,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The equipment stopped working!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.91,0:13:32.71,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Just when things were getting good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:35.12,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:38.04,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We did upgrade some of our gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:40.30,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Maybe it's conflicting \Nwith the older stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:42.23,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Where's the errand boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:45.07,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's too bad, but we'll have \Nto put the event on hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:48.40,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,On hold? But the lunch break will end!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:49.75,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Only one choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:58.17,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll broadcast the confessions \Nwith my own voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:01.60,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't be silly! \NYou'll have to be super loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:02.85,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You'll wreck your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:04.24,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Calm down, Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:07.06,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But it'll be all over \Nif we don't do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:08.51,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:10.79,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,It'll be all over...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:15.89,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,unless yours truly comes \Nthrough to save the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:17.63,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:21.01,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh, I stole it from Samejima-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:23.01,Flashback,ARISULEMON,0,0,0,,Look, a UFO!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:24.38,Flashback,SAMEJIMA,0,0,0,,What, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:27.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The teamwork between Lemon-sensei \Nand I made this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:32.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We don't know how long \Nit'll take to fix the setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:35.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So we might as well pretend \Nthis was all part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:38.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Broadcast your voice directly from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:39.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hurry, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:42.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Our clients are waiting! \NStrike while the iron's hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:50.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yamabuki-kun! \NYou always come through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:52.42,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:57.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Least I could do. \NI'm your partner in crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:14:59.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:06.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let's restart. We're keeping \Na bunch of clients waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:07.57,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:09.38,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:15.71,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The PA broadcast is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:17.60,Main,GIRL 6,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Shinobu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:22.73,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll now be using this megaphone \Nto deliver the confessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:26.24,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Please gather in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:27.62,Main,GIRL 7,0,0,0,,The courtyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:28.57,Main,GIRL 8,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:33.46,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"Mihara-kun from Class 3-A. \NI'm in love with you."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.85,Main,BOY 4,0,0,0,,Dammit, why Mihara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:39.00,Main,BOY 5,0,0,0,,It's kinda like getting a confession \Nfrom Uzuki-san herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:42.46,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"We first met up \Nin the light music club..."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:45.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm glad it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:48.10,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the waiting room, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.10,0:15:50.32,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Where'd Yamabuki-kun go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:53.68,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"If you can tell who I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:57.69,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting there \Nafter sports day is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.05,0:15:59.23,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's all."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.41,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I did it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:07.40,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Another one already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.90,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:12.52,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:15.02,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What would you like \Nto confess, and to whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:20.21,Broadcast,APOLLO,0,0,0,,The one I want to confess to is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:23.96,Main,EPTITLEB,0,0,0,,{\an8}YAMABUKI ARISU-KUN.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:26.97,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"Here's my confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.59,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You know that hole in the wall \Nbehind the gym?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:31.73,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I was the one who put it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.73,0:16:33.05,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Sorry about that!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:36.53,Main,BOY 6,0,0,0,,Okay, which idiot confessed to a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:39.02,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Don't make Shinobu-chan say that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:41.17,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Why aren't you in your gear, Yamabuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:44.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm done with all the events \NI'm participating in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:46.27,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's only logical that \NI switch back to my uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.27,0:16:47.32,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:50.57,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The broadcasting club will be \Neven busier in the PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:53.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So I'm eschewing being \Nsorry in favor of being safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.13,0:16:56.51,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Someone shut him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.51,0:16:58.75,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Lunch break will be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.11,0:17:01.27,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The next confession will be the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:03.17,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:04.91,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You were all so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.91,0:17:07.33,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we can't deliver \Nall your confessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.84,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, she hasn't flubbed \Nher lines even once today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:13.72,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Here's my confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:19.55,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I betrayed someone who gave me \Nso much support three years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:22.56,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,and I vanished from his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:26.07,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I didn't give a reason \Nor even say goodbye...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:30.32,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,because I felt that I no longer \Nhad any right to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:34.64,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,What's all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.24,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Is it a couple that broke up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:40.62,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I ran away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.08,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I didn't think I could keep our promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.51,0:17:47.42,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is this... No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.42,0:17:48.88,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,It's a promise, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:50.84,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I'll work like my life's on the line, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.84,0:17:52.93,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,so let's go see the pro world together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:57.97,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's why I was so shocked \Nwhen I heard your voice again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.25,0:18:00.44,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,At the same time, I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:04.64,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I figured you might be mad at me \Nfor breaking our promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:06.82,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:07.98,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I declare here and now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:10.24,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,that I will guide all the members \Nof the broadcasting club
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:12.53,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,and turn them into true professionals!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:15.66,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You told me the same thing \Nyou said back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:24.08,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,So I'll return the favor and tell you \Nthe same thing I said back then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:27.89,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Arisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.02,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:39.85,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's all for the proxy \Nconfession service.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:42.18,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Best of luck with the afternoon events!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:43.61,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:48.37,Main,GIRL 9,0,0,0,,Huh? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:50.34,Main,GIRL 10,0,0,0,,Was that a confession of love?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:51.57,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Arisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.57,0:18:53.51,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,As in Yamabuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.78,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,What's going on, Yamabuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:18:59.49,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}NOW STREAMING\NMIDNIGHT HEART TUNE
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:19:02.62,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,To Apollo, "I love you" \Nwas just how she signed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:06.08,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,What she said now \Nshould be no different...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:10.13,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,But she'd never directed those words \Nto "Arisu" until now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:12.72,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I must get to the bottom of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:14.88,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:29.40,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I went and said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.09,0:19:31.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uzuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:34.14,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sorry, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:36.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Who was the last person \Nto make a confession...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:41.14,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Th-That was all proxy, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:43.80,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I have no idea who made that confession!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.80,0:19:45.89,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I-I-It wasn't me, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:47.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Okay, just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:50.84,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She was this nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:56.22,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Trying to identify Apollo here would go \Nagainst the intent of the proxy service.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Uzuki. I lost my cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.89,0:20:01.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I don't care who made that confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:05.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You did great with the proxy confessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:08.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It was a fantastic event. \NI came here to tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:15.40,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:16.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't have to cry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:20.83,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Because I bulldozed ahead with my idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.83,0:20:26.37,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I was so scared it'd fail! \NI would've wasted the club's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:29.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,O-Okay, let's take this \Nsomewhere more private!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This could cause all kinds \Nof misunderstandings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:34.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If Samejima-sensei sees us like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.02,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Who cares if he gets the wrong idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:42.60,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We can just get scolded together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:44.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:46.19,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,we're partners in crime, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:55.57,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Hurry up and put all that stuff away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.57,0:20:57.80,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Sports day isn't over \Nuntil the cleanup's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:20:59.90,Main,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Then you help out too, Lemon-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:02.35,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Why? Sports day is over,\N so my job here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.35,0:21:04.73,Main,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Is it over or not? \NYou're giving mixed messages!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:09.62,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Samejima-sensei really raked me \Nover the coals for taking his megaphone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:13.00,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I couldn't help with the cleanup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.24,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll be getting an earful from the club!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.97,0:21:23.01,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}APOLLO HAS STARTED STREAMING\N"MIDNIGHT HEART TUNE"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:24.22,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}APOLLO: I'M WAITING IN \NTHE BROADCASTING ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:37.62,Broadcast,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Long time no talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:44.17,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why the string phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:45.88,Broadcast,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I can't do this face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:51.04,Broadcast,APOLLO,0,0,0,,It's been three years since we spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:54.50,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What was the deal with \Nthe proxy confession earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.87,0:21:58.38,Broadcast,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I felt like I had to express my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:22:01.16,Broadcast,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I ran away from my radio show,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.16,0:22:03.89,Broadcast,APOLLO,0,0,0,,and I guess I'm just sick of hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:05.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,While you're at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:08.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,why not show yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:10.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.89,0:22:13.84,Broadcast,APOLLO,0,0,0,,What if I said \NI was actually fine with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.77,0:22:17.69,Broadcast,APOLLO,0,0,0,,That's why I asked you \Nto come here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.69,0:22:20.69,Main,EPTITLEC,0,0,0,,{\an8}FLYBY ANOMALY
